{"data": {"__GLOBAL": {"_ATTACH_BASE_VIEW": "img.nga.cn/attachments"}, "__U": {"60916468": {"uid": 60916468, "username": "UID:60916468", "credit": 135537216, "medal": "272", "reputation": "61_671,128_1005,147_15", "groupid": -1, "memberid": 39, "avatar": null, "yz": 4, "site": null, "honor": null, "regdate": 1567950654, "mute_time": null, "postnum": 3672, "rvrc": 12, "money": 19999, "thisvisit": 1788235078, "signature": null, "nickname": null, "bit_data": 135537216, "group_bit_buf": 2048, "buffs": {"129": [[1581016, 129, 0, 60916468, 1786152653, 1788916286, 2048, 0]]}}, "150058": {"uid": 150058, "username": "UID:150058", "credit": 135537154, "medal": "272,207,157,92", "reputation": "28_30,61_0,147_775,130_10", "groupid": -1, "memberid": 73, "avatar": null, "yz": 4, "site": null, "honor": null, "regdate": 1123989606, "mute_time": null, "postnum": 42229, "rvrc": 29, "money": 90765, "thisvisit": 1788178932, "signature": null, "nickname": null, "bit_data": 135537154}, "__GROUPS": {"39": ["学徒", 98528, 39], "73": ["学徒", 360672, 73]}, "__MEDALS": {"272": ["272.gif", "棒棒糖", "叔叔请你吃棒棒糖", 272], "207": ["207.gif", "爆竹声中旧岁除", "一支红杏出墙来", 207], "157": ["157.gif", "王者之剑", "王者之剑活动纪念", 157], "92": ["92.gif", "小心死亡之翼-", "2011年大灾变开服纪念", 92]}, "__REPUTATIONS": {"147": {"60916468": 15, "150058": 775, "0": "大时代"}}}, "__R": [{"pid": 879872742, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 12, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-28 09:39", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=879871257,47288722,1653]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=39016830]reflyer[/uid] (2026-08-28 09:27):[/b]<br/><br/>这算啥 放量2W五千亿 然后是低开？  属于兔佬的放量下跌跑路么[/quote]<br/><br/>我对今天的预期原本就是小低开，这15分钟都没走完能看出来个啥", "lou": 180, "content_length": 63, "from_client": "8 Android", "reply_to": 879871257, "postdatetimestamp": 1787881154}, {"pid": 879877275, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 7, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-28 10:13", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "我已经在看券券的买点了[s:ac:呆]", "lou": 181, "content_length": 20, "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1787883180}, {"pid": 879877850, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 22, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-28 10:17", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "今天不太想买了，累了，等洞内传声吧，该调整就调整，该右侧就右侧，躺平了", "lou": 182, "content_length": 70, "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1787883454}, {"pid": 879878225, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 44, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-28 10:20", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "昨天尾盘狗队砸盘，今天尾盘如果走弱了这个b是不是还要买回来，他现在是每天都要做T是吗？娜美娜被抓去操盘了？", "lou": 183, "content_length": 104, "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1787883627}, {"pid": 879881895, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 41, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-28 10:47", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "昨天英伟达飞起来涨，今天大盘都能被ma60反压，科技冲高回落，那外围萎靡一点你A叔叔不得当场钻地啊<br/><br/>我现在就希望狗队别托着了，在这磨实在是太折磨了，有的时候爱一个人需要学会放手，裁判要是不理解可以去问问claude", "lou": 184, "content_length": 201, "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1787885231}, {"pid": 879883364, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 14, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-28 10:57", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "按今天这个量能，搞不好是散户把主力挂在山顶上了[s:ac:茶]", "lou": 185, "content_length": 44, "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1787885846}, {"pid": 879883526, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 4, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-28 10:58", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=879883248,47288722,1675]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=41410793]流冰之晶[/uid] (2026-08-28 10:56):[/b]<br/><br/>大A有两个我比较喜欢的买入点：<br/><br/><br/>分支一：<br/>1. 外围跌了好几天，我们也跌了好几天<br/>2.外围大涨，次日我们高开低走(小阴小阳)，骂声一片<br/>3.晚上美股继续低开高走，次日我们高开但幅度没那么大(情绪不好)，高开后往下砸，骂声更大<br/>4.此时情绪到达冰点，就是买点<br/><br/>分支二：<br/>1.外围小跌，我们大跌，持续几天，骂声一片<br/>2.外围终于大跌，晚上恐慌情绪蔓延<br/>3.次日我们大低开，开盘买点<br/><br/>其他时候看不出太大确定性[/quote]<br/><br/>被你这么一说我突然有点惭愧，最近我的骂声好像不小[s:ac:呆]", "lou": 186, "content_length": 51, "from_client": "8 Android", "reply_to": 879883248, "postdatetimestamp": 1787885906}, {"pid": 879883842, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 19, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-28 11:00", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=879883604,47288722,1676]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=66056898]行云式[/uid] (2026-08-28 10:59):[/b]<br/><br/>肯定啊兔佬，我都把狼大洗出去了，我买的筹码发货人是狼大，等涨起来的，我要给他科普基本面我要去笑他[s:ac:花痴][/quote]<br/><br/>记得给他科普一下macd，boll，暗盘资金，主力动向这些时髦新潮的技术名词，让狼头也好好学习一下[s:ac:茶]", "lou": 187, "content_length": 93, "from_client": "8 Android", "reply_to": 879883604, "postdatetimestamp": 1787886048}, {"pid": 879884293, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 5, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-28 11:03", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "真的不爽，买一手透景生命[s:ac:汗]", "lou": 188, "content_length": 22, "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1787886223}, {"pid": 879885090, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 27, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-28 11:08", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "狼楼里面到现在还没有追高之后大声狗叫的，看来都学的很聪明啊，个个都是炒股高手，学的不聪明的估计已经退市了", "lou": 189, "content_length": 104, "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1787886537}, {"pid": 879885337, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 20, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-28 11:10", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=879885042,47288722,1678]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=64195557]液滴右移[/uid] (2026-08-28 11:08):[/b]<br/><br/>韭菜提问：这种科技集体出货局面，真的能狠拉金融把大盘拉上4000吗，然后谁还能再冲进科技[/quote]<br/><br/>谁告诉你一定能上4000的[s:ac:晕]你目标是考上清北，最后考上个普通一本你就不活了吗？那不就只能放低预期该咋过咋过<br/><br/>只是今天确实走的丑，哎，闲的没事多骂骂主力就行，营造一个骂声一片的氛围", "lou": 190, "content_length": 173, "from_client": "8 Android", "reply_to": 879885042, "postdatetimestamp": 1787886637}, {"pid": 879902126, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 64, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-28 13:38", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "喜欢你的女人根本不会在乎你的指甲扎不扎人，把你推开是因为在做心理建设<br/><br/>同样的，想做多的主力根本不在乎这只票散户多不多，突破均线失败被反压是因为在诱多出货", "lou": 191, "content_length": 150, "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1787895495}, {"pid": 879902964, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 27, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-28 13:46", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=879902305,47288722,1692]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=39235785]Doh丶[/uid] (2026-08-28 13:40):[/b]<br/><br/>兔哥现在贤者时间吗[/quote]<br/><br/>他妈的看到下午这个盘面哪个多头能忍住不笑，反正我是破绷了[s:ac:茶]现在就是每天过来和兄弟们串一串娱乐一下，等行情", "lou": 192, "content_length": 105, "from_client": "8 Android", "reply_to": 879902305, "postdatetimestamp": 1787895996}, {"pid": 879905525, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 37, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-28 14:09", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "仓位是大a投资者的灵魂，那些失去了仓位的、如同行尸走肉般的人，我们管他们叫做无仓者", "lou": 193, "content_length": 81, "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1787897396}, {"pid": 879905580, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 13, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-28 14:10", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=879905093,47288722,1696]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=150058]-阿狼-[/uid] (2026-08-28 14:05):[/b]<br/><br/>我听说你们很多人昨天前天冲了胜宏  能不能和我说说为啥去送人头？ 是有什么特殊事件吗<br/>下午太无聊了  听点八卦[/quote]<br/><br/>你吃过螺狮粉吗？[s:ac:哭笑]", "lou": 194, "content_length": 19, "from_client": "8 Android", "reply_to": 879905093, "postdatetimestamp": 1787897431}, {"pid": 879906918, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 12, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-28 14:22", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=879905735,47288722,1698]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=67143133]keungy[/uid] (2026-08-28 14:11):[/b]<br/><br/>满仓的呢[s:ac:哭笑][/quote]<br/><br/>套牢是凉爽的夏夜，可供人无忧地安眠", "lou": 195, "content_length": 39, "from_client": "8 Android", "reply_to": 879905735, "postdatetimestamp": 1787898153}, {"pid": 879907594, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 24, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-28 14:28", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=879907119,47288722,1701]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=41884297]砂锅丶[/uid] (2026-08-28 14:24):[/b]<br/><br/>狼友们轻仓谈笑风生，我重仓不知道该咋办，难受得不想说话[s:ac:晕][/quote]<br/><br/>这是勇敢的散户，在怒吼的大A里，在量化中间，高傲的飞翔；这是胜利的预言家在叫喊：<br/>让暴风雨来得更猛烈些吧！", "lou": 196, "content_length": 108, "from_client": "8 Android", "reply_to": 879907119, "postdatetimestamp": 1787898502}, {"pid": 879908077, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 0, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-28 14:33", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "我上次去潮汕，被寄生虫和肠胃炎的传闻骇住了，一口生腌和鱼生都没敢吃", "lou": 197, "content_length": 66, "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1787898782}, {"pid": 879962379, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 25, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-29 00:28", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "我自从上次被沃什坑了个大的之后，就再也不信这个人会放鸽了[s:ac:茶]他现在就是一个绝望的裱糊匠", "lou": 198, "content_length": 80, "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1787934495}, {"pid": 879975396, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 46, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-29 08:58", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "大早上就看到你们在蛐蛐我[s:ng:气愤]", "lou": 199, "content_lengt